    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965980/extras/8799c00a4512fc546ec87be87d2ab5cc.poster.avif?t=1714319245\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965980/extras/8799c00a4512fc546ec87be87d2ab5cc.webm?t=1714319245\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965980/extras/8799c00a4512fc546ec87be87d2ab5cc.mp4?t=1714319245\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>You've been hired by the <i>slightly shady</i> Clookoo Transport company to travel the world cleaning up corruption that they <i>may have caused</i>. In return, you get your very own free* train station! <br><br>*Train station is only free if you work an unpaid job for the rest of your life.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965980/extras/bf889e7bc215db267811f6c63f8c6cc0.avif?t=1714319245\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965980/extras/aef98c30ff07fd9edd631fce46f9c5e4.poster.avif?t=1714319245\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965980/extras/aef98c30ff07fd9edd631fce46f9c5e4.webm?t=1714319245\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965980/extras/aef98c30ff07fd9edd631fce46f9c5e4.mp4?t=1714319245\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Purchase seeds from the gift shop, plant them, and watch them grow!<br></li><li>Improve your farming skills and get <strong>rare</strong> variant crops!<br></li><li>Not a fan of watching crops grow? Click near your crops to help them grow quicker!<br></li><li>Discover all sorts of things to plant from ancient vegetables to golden fruit!</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965980/extras/acbd7658553ffc3ca60415c58fa84bd0.avif?t=1714319245\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965980/extras/6ef8e72fa3b248650e4caf040221d060.poster.avif?t=1714319245\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965980/extras/6ef8e72fa3b248650e4caf040221d060.webm?t=1714319245\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965980/extras/6ef8e72fa3b248650e4caf040221d060.mp4?t=1714319245\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Feed gellis for different effects depending on the biome like creating spells and even giving you money!<br></li><li>Watch them interact with their environment and each other. Each gelli has its own personality!<br></li><li>Read about each gelli in their biomes <i>gelli book</i>! <br></li><li>Give a gelli its favorite food and you might get a gift!<br><br> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965980/extras/cc971d5c46067bc25140e3cd53992082.avif?t=1714319245\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965980/extras/1ae43914e79e650c5ae557baf1bda6b2.poster.avif?t=1714319245\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965980/extras/1ae43914e79e650c5ae557baf1bda6b2.webm?t=1714319245\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965980/extras/1ae43914e79e650c5ae557baf1bda6b2.mp4?t=1714319245\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Collect over 40 &quot;critter&quot; items like fish and bugs!<br></li><li>Interact with birds before they fly away to collect their feathers!<br></li><li>Give feathers, fish, and bugs to <i>Mr.Collector</i> and unlock <strong>hats </strong>for your gellis!<br></li><li>Enjoy fun minigames like juggling wooden logs, mining through a mountain, and more!</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965980/extras/54e7173b350cede2dc41bfa7f7afddac.avif?t=1714319245\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965980/extras/6866d661349f660a1c8063ad7c0ef74b.poster.avif?t=1714319245\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965980/extras/6866d661349f660a1c8063ad7c0ef74b.webm?t=1714319245\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965980/extras/6866d661349f660a1c8063ad7c0ef74b.mp4?t=1714319245\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>As you play your luck level increases, making rare events more likely to occur!<br></li><li>Each biome has a charm that gives incredible powers like planting three crops at once.<br></li><li>Complete challenges in biomes to unlock and build amenities that improve your skills across all biomes.</li></ul><br> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965980/extras/4ce36f8c8b7fed046a27cfbbae3db6d4.avif?t=1714319245\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965980/extras/08edc2b0d06859ec811126f2653a7825.poster.avif?t=1714319245\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965980/extras/08edc2b0d06859ec811126f2653a7825.webm?t=1714319245\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965980/extras/08edc2b0d06859ec811126f2653a7825.mp4?t=1714319245\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Travel to 7 distinct biomes all with their own playstyle and unique mechanics.<br></li><li>Visit a farm where everything gets covered in mud.<br></li><li>Explore an archeological dig site and restore the museum.<br></li><li>Help a pirate cat reclaim her lost treasure on a remote beach.</li></ul><br>Gelli Fields is a project that comes from the heart. Thank you so much for checking this out.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965980/extras/4b4208bd1dac22cbaf864784832c6b92.avif?t=1714319245\" /></div></li></ul>",
